[{"id":"smp-436ae2c4cb1946fe9951dbc11895244b","q":"CMCR-Q0039","question":"千川直播引流素材和商品广告素材有什么区别，在哪里看？","day":1,"repeat":1,"valid":true,"answer":"# 一、两者核心区别\n### ✅ 直播引流素材（推直播计划）\n**目标：把人拉进直播间，成交发生在直播间内**\n- 转化链路：刷到短视频 → 点击进入直播间 → 主播讲解下单\n- 素材类型：**只支持视频**（不支持图片），大多是直播切片、痛点短视频，不把全部卖点、价格、福利一次性说完，留钩子引导进直播间看主播\n- 投放位置：抖音信息流短视频，点视频直接跳转直播间\n- 优化目标：**进入直播间、直播间停留、直播间成交**\n\n### ✅ 商品广告素材（推商品/商品卡计划）\n**目标：用户看完直接下单，不需要进直播间**\n- 转化链路：刷视频/商城看到素材 → 点小黄车/商品卡 → 商品详情页直接下单\n- 素材类型：**视频 + 图片/图文**（商品主图、轮播图、商品卡图都属于这类素材），必须把卖点、效果、价格一次性讲清楚，用户看素材就要直接产生下单意愿\n- 投放位置：短视频信息流、抖音商城、搜索结果页、购后页等货架场景\n- 优化目标：**商品点击、商品直接成交、商品ROI**\n\n> 一句话总结：\n> 直播引流素材负责**引流进直播间**；商品广告素材负责**直接卖货**，两条素材逻辑不一样，不建议直接复用。\n\n# 二、在哪里查看（PC千川后台为主）\n## 1、看自己账户已上传/投放素材（素材管理）\n登录巨量千川PC后台（qianchuan.jinritemai.com）\n1. 顶部【工具】→【素材管理】（素材库/视频库）\n    - 可筛选：**计划类型：直播推广 / 商品推广**，分开看两类素材\n    - 可预览、下载、看消耗、点击率、转化数据，查看素材标签（首发/高效/低效）\n2. 【推广管理】→【计划列表】，点开单个计划，在创意模块，直接看该计划绑定的素材\n    - 计划类型=直播推广 → 就是直播引流素材\n    - 计划类型=商品推广 → 就是商品广告素材\n\n## 2、看同行/行业参考素材（找爆款参考）\n1. **电商罗盘（抖店后台）**：市场→内容榜单，可筛选「引流短视频（直播引流素材）」、「带货短视频（商品广告素材）」，看行业爆款素材、消耗、成交数据\n2. **巨量创意 / 巨量云图极速版**：创意洞察，可以筛选类目，区分**引流短视频（直播）、带货短视频（商品）**，看行业跑量素材参考\n\n## 3、移动端（小店随心推）\n小店随心推APP/抖音随心推小程序，创建计划时：\n- 选【推直播】，上传的就是直播引流素材\n- 选【推商品】，上传的就是商品广告素材；创意页可查看历史素材\n\n# 三、小提示\n1. 直播计划**不能用图片素材**；商品计划视频、图片素材都支持\n2. 同一支视频，可以同时放到直播计划、商品计划，但两条计划的点击率、转化逻辑会差异很大\n3. 素材管理里可以批量筛选低效素材，及时关停，避免消耗浪费\n","answerHash":"4f0373754329e89c872fe639119c46114502911da039e88d0e5bc50bf1d77f7d","finishedAt":"2026-10-12","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help?pageId=221","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help?pageId=221","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"获取全域投放计划下素材-千川PC乘方& 全域投放-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1804363488115850","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1804363488115850","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"API接口 - 商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1810701753348235","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1810701753348235","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量千川入口 - 产品介绍 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213224","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213224","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"文章详情 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help/content/root?graphId=397","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help/content/root?graphId=397","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量千川简介 - 产品介绍 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213216","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213216","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量创意","url":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/article-detail/10133","normalizedUrl":"https://cc.oceanengine.com/academy/article-detail/10133","domain":"cc.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"API接口 - 商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1698797636713486","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1698797636713486","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"小店随心推帮助中心","url":"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/course/7336028836495374267?lessonId=7436028846495368993&spaceId=185","normalizedUrl":"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/course/7336028836495374267?lessonId=7436028846495368993&spaceId=185","domain":"support.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"中小商家千川广告投放运营基础及工具使用","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8APt?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_message","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8APt?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_message","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"文章详情 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help/content/root?graphId=397","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help/content/root?graphId=397","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量千川官网","url":"https://www.shoppingads.cn/","normalizedUrl":"https://www.shoppingads.cn/","domain":"www.shoppingads.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"","url":"","normalizedUrl":"","domain":"","validUrl":false,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"smp-c56c785c6a2e4ae1a6961a44088b0615","q":"CMCR-Q0039","question":"千川直播引流素材和商品广告素材有什么区别，在哪里看？","day":1,"repeat":2,"valid":true,"answer":"# 一、两者核心区别\n## ✅ 直播引流素材（推直播计划）\n**目标：把人引进直播间，成交在直播间完成**\n- 转化链路：刷到短视频 → 点击进入直播间 → 主播讲解、逼单成交\n- 内容逻辑：3秒钩子抓注意力，只讲痛点、效果、直播间福利预告；**不把价格、全部卖点一次性讲透**，把转化留给主播\n- 素材形式：短视频（直播切片、预告短视频），也可以直接用**直播间画面（LiveHead）**当创意\n- 优化指标：**直播间进入率、直播间点击率、看播时长**，最终看直播间ROI\n- 投放计划类型：千川【推广直播间】计划\n\n## ✅ 商品广告素材（推商品/短视频带货计划）\n**目标：用户看完视频直接点小黄车/商品卡下单，不需要进直播间**\n- 转化链路：刷视频 → 点购物车 → 商品详情页直接下单\n- 内容逻辑：视频内一次性讲清**全部卖点、效果、价格、信任背书**，用户看完就要下决心下单，没有主播答疑\n- 素材形式：短视频、图片、图文、商品主图（商品卡素材）\n- 优化指标：**小黄车点击率、商品点击、直接成交ROI**\n- 投放计划类型：千川【推广商品】短视频带货 / 商品卡计划\n\n|对比项|直播引流素材|商品广告素材|\n| ---- | ---- | ---- |\n|核心目的|引流进直播间|短视频内直接卖货|\n|转化发生地|直播间|商品详情页|\n|内容重点|吸引点击进直播间，卖点留到直播间|视频讲完整卖点，促当场下单|\n|素材类型|短视频、直播间实时画面|短视频、图片、图文、商品方图|\n|核心指标|直播间进入率|商品点击、视频成交|\n\n> 简单一句话：**直播引流素材负责“拉人进房”；商品广告素材负责“视频里直接卖货”**，素材不能直接混用，脚本逻辑完全不一样\n\n# 二、在哪里查看素材（自己账户素材 + 同行参考素材）\n## 1、千川PC后台（看自己账户素材）\n1. 登录巨量千川PC后台：qianchuan.jinritemai.com\n2. 入口1：**工具 → 素材管理**\n    - 素材库：所有上传视频/图片，可筛选素材所属计划（推直播 / 推商品），查看消耗、点击率、转化数据\n    - 素材评估：看高效/低效/首发素材标签\n3. 入口2：**推广管理 → 计划列表**\n    点开单个计划，查看创意，区分【直播推广计划创意】和【商品推广计划创意】\n\n## 2、官方灵感素材库（看行业同行爆款参考）\n1. **巨量创意 cc.oceanengine.com**\n    千川专区，筛选：引流短视频（直播引流素材）、带货短视频（商品广告素材），看行业跑量样片\n2. 电商罗盘/巨量云图极速版：内容→创意洞察，区分**引流短视频 / 带货短视频**筛选同行素材\n\n## 3、小店随心推（移动端）\n抖音APP → 我 → 右上角≡ → 更多功能 → 小店随心推，创建计划时上传/选择素材；也可在历史计划查看过往创意。\n\n## 4、第三方工具（蝉妈妈、新抖等，付费）\n创意素材库，可筛选广告类型：**直播引流素材 / 商品带货素材**，看同行正在投放的广告视频。\n\n\n\n要不要我给你一份直播引流素材 vs 商品广告素材的短视频脚本模板，直接拿去拍？","answerHash":"c84456f0e31989fa1e30229643c77a1f1fd3a20e475f4facfc4fea694fd6064a","finishedAt":"2026-10-12","replacement":false,"brands":["蝉妈妈"],"sources":[{"title":"巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help?pageId=221","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/help?pageId=221","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"获取全域投放计划下素材-千川PC乘方& 全域投放-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1804363488115850","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/18043634881